    "Confirm together": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "まとめて確認"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Looking for people to merge…": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "まとめられる人物を探しています…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which of these are the same person as above?": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上の人物と同じ人はどれですか？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which of these are “%@”?": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」はどれですか？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap the ones that are the same person.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同じ人物の写真をタップして選んでください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Select all": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "すべて選ぶ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clear all": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "選択を解除"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Merge %lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld件をまとめる"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Merged %lld entries.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld件をまとめました。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing left to merge right now.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "いまはまとめられるものはありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Answers are applied right away, and the next overnight analysis uses them too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "回答はすぐに反映され、次回の夜間解析にも使われます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Find more": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "次を探す"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "See all": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "すべて表示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Search people": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "人物を検索"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The same person may be split into several entries.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同じ人物が複数に分かれていることがあります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Children change a lot as they grow, so one child can end up as many entries. Confirm them together to merge them quickly.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "子どもは成長で顔が大きく変わるため、1人が多数に分かれることがあります。「まとめて確認」で一度にまとめられます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Next person": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "次の人へ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld were kept separate because they have different names or appear together in the same photo.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld件は統合しませんでした（別の名前が付いている、または同じ写真に一緒に写っているため）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Are both of these “%@”?": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "どちらも「%@」さんですか？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatic analysis": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自動で解析する"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Indexes your photos in the background so AI albums and search stay up to date. Power and network conditions are set in Settings → Background & Battery.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI アルバムと検索を最新に保つため、写真をバックグラウンドで解析します。電源と回線の条件は「設定 → バックグラウンドとバッテリー」で指定します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Run image analysis conservatively": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "画像分析を控えめに動かす"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Analysis never runs while you are using the app — only when you switch away or your iPhone is locked. Recommended: no slowdowns while browsing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "アプリを使っている間は解析しません（他のアプリに切り替えたときや、iPhone をロックしている間だけ動きます）。閲覧中に遅くならない推奨設定です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Analysis also runs while the app is open, once you have not touched the screen for 20 seconds. It stops as soon as you interact again — indexing finishes sooner, but you may notice brief slowdowns.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "アプリを開いたままでも、20 秒操作がなければ解析します。画面に触れるとすぐ止まります。解析は早く終わりますが、短い引っかかりを感じることがあります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI analysis: nothing detected": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI 解析：検出なし"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On this iPhone": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この iPhone 内"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Dropbox": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dropbox 内"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show whole photo": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "写真全体を表示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show face only": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "顔だけ表示"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.1"
}
